1
00:00:00,934 --> 00:00:02,974
(Vet:)I'm sorry, is this a joke to you?

2
00:00:03,136 --> 00:00:04,616
(Sheldon:)No.

3
00:00:04,805 --> 00:00:06,285
(Leonard:)Maybe to her.

4
00:00:08,942 --> 00:00:10,322
(Vet:)How big a box of chocolate was it?

5
00:00:10,477 --> 00:00:12,147
(Penny:)Something like this. I don't know.

6
00:00:12,312 --> 00:00:14,262
It cams free with a full tank of gas.

7
00:00:15,715 --> 00:00:17,825
(Leonard:)Really? Do you know how much
those Lakers tickets were?

8
00:00:17,984 --> 00:00:19,824
(Penny:)-Do you know how much gas is?
-Hey!

9
00:00:20,587 --> 00:00:21,997
(Amy:)-Sorry.
-Sorry.

10
00:00:23,757 --> 00:00:25,927
(Raj:)Oh, my God, Cinnamon,
are you OK?!

11
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:27,763
I can't believe you two!

12
00:00:27,928 --> 00:00:29,408
(Raj:)You do whatever it takes
to save her life.

13
00:00:29,596 --> 00:00:31,506
(Raj:)If she needs new organs,
I'll buy any dog necessary

14
00:00:31,665 --> 00:00:33,475
and scrap them for parts!

15
00:00:35,001 --> 00:00:37,841
(Vet:)-You're the owner?
-Owner, father, soul mate,

16
00:00:38,004 --> 00:00:40,844
(Raj:)and if anything happens to her,
your worst nightmare!

17
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:45,920
(Vet:)Well, she's not throwing up,
which is a good sign.

18
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:48,459
(Vet:)So, I'm gonna take her in back,
put her on fluids

19
00:00:48,615 --> 00:00:50,185
(Vet:)and give her something
to absorb the toxins.

20
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:51,850
OK. OK, thank you.

21
00:00:52,018 --> 00:00:55,368
(Raj:)If she's scared, you can sing to her.
She likes Katy Perry.

22
00:00:56,189 --> 00:00:59,019
But don't do "Firework"
That gets her all riled up.

